        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonke lamadoda empi eselungele ukulwa afika eHebroni ezimisele ukubeka uDavida abe yinkosi yabakoIsrayeli bonke; ngokunjalo labo bonke abanye bakoIsrayeli babelengqondonye yokubeka uDavida abe yinkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahlala lapho loDavida insuku ezintathu besidla benatha, ngoba abafowabo babebalungisele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi labomakhelwane babo kuze kube koIsakari lakoZebuluni lakoNafitali baletha ukudla ngabobabhemi langamakamela langezimbongolo langezinkabi, impuphu, lezinkwa zomkhiwa, lamahlukuzo ezithelo zevini ezomisiweyo, lewayini, lamafutha, lezinkabi, lezimvu, ngoba kwakukhona ukuthokoza koIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
